under your seats. On my command... Argh!

21:03.841 --> 21:08.345
Argh! You idiots! I had them!
Cindi was right. We need a lot more work.

21:09.261 --> 21:11.473
Uh, excuse me. Yeah.

21:11.557 --> 21:13.641
Uh, hi. I'm Peter Griffin.

21:13.766 --> 21:18.560
Listen, uh, as many of you may know,
I recently came into some money.

21:18.644 --> 21:21.145
